{"seq":2,"slug":"tree-parzen-estimators","title":"TPE 与 BOHB","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/algorithms/tree-parzen-estimators","wordCount":1618,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"tpe-与-bohb\">TPE 与 BOHB</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>TPE 密度比</strong>：建模 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(\\mathbf{x}|y &lt; y^*)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(\\mathbf{x}|y \\geq y^*)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的密度比，等价于 EI 优化但绕开 GP</li>\n<li><strong>BOHB 融合</strong>：TPE 配置采样 + Hyperband 多保真度调度，兼得模型指导和资源高效</li>\n<li><strong>DEHB/PriorBand</strong>：差分进化和专家先验的引入，解决高维离散和冷启动问题</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"tpe-的密度估计范式\">TPE 的密度估计范式</h2><p>Tree-structured Parzen Estimator（TPE）从一个与 GP-based SMBO 截然不同的角度构建贝叶斯优化。它不直接建模 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(y|\\mathbf{x})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（给定配置预测性能），而是建模 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(\\mathbf{x}|y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（给定性能水平，什么样的配置最可能产生该性能）。</p>\n<p>具体地，TPE 将已有观测按目标值分为两组：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（好的配置的密度）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l(\\mathbf{x}) = p(\\mathbf{x} | y &lt; y^*) \\quad \\text{（好的配置的密度）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（好的配置的密度）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（差的配置的密度）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(\\mathbf{x}) = p(\\mathbf{x} | y \\geq y^*) \\quad \\text{（差的配置的密度）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（差的配置的密度）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是分位数阈值（通常取观测值的前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma = 25\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25%</span></span></span></span></span> 分位）。然后 TPE 选择使密度比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l(\\mathbf{x})/g(\\mathbf{x})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 最大的点——直觉上就是&quot;更像好配置而非差配置&quot;的点。</p>\n<p>可以证明，最大化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l(\\mathbf{x})/g(\\mathbf{x})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 等价于最大化 EI 的一个特殊形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EI</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∝</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EI}(\\mathbf{x}) \\propto \\left(\\gamma + \\frac{g(\\mathbf{x})}{l(\\mathbf{x})}(1-\\gamma)\\right)^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EI</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.604em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.654em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这意味着 TPE 在本质上也是在做&quot;期望改进&quot;优化，只是绕开了 GP 建模直接走密度估计路线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tpe-的核心优势\">TPE 的核心优势</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>GP-EI (SMBO)</th>\n<th>TPE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>计算复杂度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件参数处理</td>\n<td>需要特殊核设计</td>\n<td>树结构天然支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类别变量</td>\n<td>需要 one-hot 或特殊核</td>\n<td>直接核密度估计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维度扩展</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d &gt; 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 困难</td>\n<td>独立维度假设下可到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d &gt; 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不确定性建模</td>\n<td>精确后验</td>\n<td>无显式不确定性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>观测间相关性</td>\n<td>完全建模</td>\n<td>维度间独立假设</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>TPE 对每个超参数维度独立估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l(x_d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(x_d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——这是一个强独立性假设，意味着它忽略了参数间的交互效应。对于学习率和动量之间存在强耦合的场景，GP 的全协方差建模理论上更优。但实践中，TPE 凭借低计算成本和对树结构搜索空间的原生支持，在高维超参数优化中往往表现更好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"optuna-中的-tpe-实现\">Optuna 中的 TPE 实现</h2><p>Optuna（截至 v4.9.0，2026 年 6 月）以 TPE 作为默认采样器（<code>TPESampler</code>）。其实现包含多项增强：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import optuna&#10;&#10;sampler = optuna.samplers.TPESampler(&#10;    n_startup_trials=10,       # 随机初始化 trial 数&#10;    n_ei_candidates=24,        # EI 候选点数&#10;    multivariate=True,         # 多变量 TPE（考虑变量间相关性）&#10;    group=True,                # 对条件参数分组处理&#10;    constant_liar=True,        # 并行时使用常数谎言策略&#10;    seed=42&#10;)&#10;&#10;study = optuna.create_study(sampler=sampler)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> optuna</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sampler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> optuna.samplers.TPESampler(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    n_startup_trials</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 随机初始化 trial 数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    n_ei_candidates</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># EI 候选点数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    multivariate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 多变量 TPE（考虑变量间相关性）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    group</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 对条件参数分组处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    constant_liar</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 并行时使用常数谎言策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    seed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">study </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> optuna.create_study(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sampler</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sampler)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>多变量 TPE</strong>（<code>multivariate=True</code>）通过多变量 Parzen 估计器缓解维度独立假设——对参数组内使用联合核密度估计。Optuna 4.x 中此选项已默认开启。</p>\n<p><strong>约束感知 TPE</strong>：Optuna 支持通过 trial 的 <code>system_attrs</code> 传递约束满足状态，TPE 在构建 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l(\\mathbf{x})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 时只使用满足约束的好 trial。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bohb-tpe-与-hyperband-的融合\">BOHB：TPE 与 Hyperband 的融合</h2><p>BOHB（Bayesian Optimization HyperBand）由 Falkner et al. (2018) 提出，将 TPE 的模型指导能力与 Hyperband 的资源高效分配结合。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[BOHB 循环开始] --&gt; B[Hyperband 调度器&lt;br/&gt;决定预算分配]&#10;    B --&gt; C{需要新配置?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[TPE 建议新配置&lt;br/&gt;基于 l/g 密度比]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E[继续训练已有配置]&#10;    D --&gt; F[在最低保真度 b_min 评估]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[Successive Halving&lt;br/&gt;淘汰下位 1/eta]&#10;    G --&gt; H{达到最高保真度?}&#10;    H --&gt;|否| F&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[记录最终结果]&#10;    I --&gt; J[更新 TPE 密度模型]&#10;    J --&gt; A\">graph TD\n    A[BOHB 循环开始] --&gt; B[Hyperband 调度器&lt;br/&gt;决定预算分配]\n    B --&gt; C{需要新配置?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[TPE 建议新配置&lt;br/&gt;基于 l/g 密度比]\n    C --&gt;|否| E[继续训练已有配置]\n    D --&gt; F[在最低保真度 b_min 评估]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[Successive Halving&lt;br/&gt;淘汰下位 1/eta]\n    G --&gt; H{达到最高保真度?}\n    H --&gt;|否| F\n    H --&gt;|是| I[记录最终结果]\n    I --&gt; J[更新 TPE 密度模型]\n    J --&gt; A</pre><p>BOHB 的核心设计选择：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>配置采样</strong>：用 TPE（而非随机）生成新配置——比纯 Hyperband 更高效地覆盖好区域</li>\n<li><strong>预算管理</strong>：继承 Hyperband 的 Successive Halving 多保真度调度——在低保真度快速淘汰差配置</li>\n<li><strong>密度模型构建</strong>：只使用达到相同保真度水平的 trial 构建 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l/g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>——避免不同保真度间的性能不可比</li>\n</ul>\n<p>BOHB 在实践中结合了 Hyperband 的强任意时间性能（anytime performance）和 TPE 的模型指导最终性能，使其成为通用 HPO 的强基线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dehb-差分进化-hyperband\">DEHB：差分进化 + Hyperband</h2><p>DEHB（Awad et al., 2021）解决了 BOHB 在高维离散空间中的不足。它用差分进化（DE）替代 TPE 作为配置生成器：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>变异</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{v} = \\mathbf{x}_{r1} + F \\cdot (\\mathbf{x}_{r2} - \\mathbf{x}_{r3})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 是缩放因子</li>\n<li><strong>交叉</strong>：以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CR</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 从变异向量取维度，否则保留父代</li>\n<li><strong>选择</strong>：与 Hyperband 的 Successive Halving 结合——子代在低保真度评估，优于父代则替换</li>\n</ul>\n<p>DEHB 在 HPO 基准上比 BOHB 快 32 倍、比随机搜索快 1000 倍，尤其擅长高维离散空间（如 NAS 表格基准）。其计算开销极低——没有模型拟合成本，只有进化算子的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"priorband-融合专家先验\">PriorBand：融合专家先验</h2><p>PriorBand（NeurIPS 2023）针对深度学习实践者的真实工作流设计：研究者通常对好的超参数区域有先验直觉（如&quot;学习率大概在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\times 10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 附近&quot;），现有 HPO 方法却忽略了这些信息。</p>\n<p>PriorBand 的多信号融合策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号源</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>权重调节</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>专家先验分布</td>\n<td>在先验区域集中采样</td>\n<td>先验强则权重大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低保真度评估</td>\n<td>快速筛选有潜力的区域</td>\n<td>相关性高则权重大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机探索</td>\n<td>防止先验错误导致灾难性聚焦</td>\n<td>保底 1/3 分配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>当专家先验准确时，PriorBand 显著加速收敛（在 Transformer 1B 语言模型调参上领先 Hyperband 约 3 倍）；当先验不准确时，随机探索分量确保性能不退化到 Hyperband 以下——这种鲁棒性对生产环境至关重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选择指南\">选择指南</h2><p>决策何时使用哪种算法取决于问题特征：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>标准 TPE / Optuna 默认</strong>：大多数情况的首选——低开销、支持任意搜索空间、足够好的样本效率</li>\n<li><strong>GP-EI / Ax 默认</strong>：低维（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\leq 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span>）连续空间，评估非常昂贵（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 次试验预算），需要精确的不确定性量化</li>\n<li><strong>BOHB</strong>：中等维度、有多保真度信号（如 epoch 数可变），需要好的任意时间性能</li>\n<li><strong>DEHB</strong>：高维离散空间、NAS 表格基准、计算预算紧张</li>\n<li><strong>PriorBand</strong>：有可靠的专家先验、深度学习训练场景、少量试验预算</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些算法不是互斥的——<a href=\"../practice/optuna-ax-platform\">Optuna 与 Ax 平台</a>允许灵活切换和组合不同的采样策略，甚至在同一 study 中按阶段使用不同算法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>TPE 通过密度估计巧妙绕开了 GP 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 瓶颈和高维困难，以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 代价处理条件和离散空间。BOHB 将 TPE 与 Hyperband 融合实现了强任意时间性能。DEHB 进一步用差分进化替代 TPE 攻克高维离散问题。PriorBand 引入专家先验在极少 trial 预算下加速收敛。选择哪种算法取决于维度、离散性、可用先验和预算——Optuna 默认 TPE 是大多数场景的合理起点。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"TPE 与 BOHB","id":"tpe-与-bohb"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"TPE 的密度估计范式","id":"tpe-的密度估计范式"},{"level":2,"text":"TPE 的核心优势","id":"tpe-的核心优势"},{"level":2,"text":"Optuna 中的 TPE 实现","id":"optuna-中的-tpe-实现"},{"level":2,"text":"BOHB：TPE 与 Hyperband 的融合","id":"bohb-tpe-与-hyperband-的融合"},{"level":2,"text":"DEHB：差分进化 + Hyperband","id":"dehb-差分进化-hyperband"},{"level":2,"text":"PriorBand：融合专家先验","id":"priorband-融合专家先验"},{"level":2,"text":"选择指南","id":"选择指南"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"序贯模型优化（SMBO）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/algorithms/sequential-model-based"},"next":{"title":"多保真度方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/algorithms/multi-fidelity-methods"}}